      "description_html": "<div class=\"product-detail__column product-detail__column--text\">\n<div class=\"product-detail__content-sticky\">\n<div class=\"product-detail__content-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"product-detail__body-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"o-container\">\n<div class=\"o-grid\">\n<div class=\"o-col-24 o-col-20--sm u-pre-2--sm o-col-16--lg u-pre-4--lg\">\n<div class=\"product-detail__body\">\n<div class=\"u-margin-top-32 u-margin-top-48--lg u-margin-top-80--xlg u-text--large\">\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>The Diamond design piece reinterprets the quintessential diamond shape throughout contemporary design, a beautiful outcome of architectural thinking with elegant faceted lines. A single module watch winder that provides proper care and secure storage to high-end watches. Lapidated like a precious stone, this beautiful piece is sculpted in mahogany wood, finished in lacquer or gold leaf and high gloss varnish coat, featuring one single rotor that will keep an automatic watch mechanism going long after time takes its toll. A precious object that will turn any timer into a display piece, enhancing any elegant and luxury room.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-detail__column product-detail__column--image u-background--light-grey\">\n<div class=\"product-detail__image-item u-visible-up--md\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"info_product_01 col-xs-6 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"info_product_01 col-xs-6 col-sm-12\">\n<p>W 26 CM | 10.2 IN <br>D 25 CM | 9.8 IN <br>H 20 CM | 7.9 IN</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>"
